{"type": "message", "id": "30c32725", "parentId": "b3a1fb10", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T09:03:19.488Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "functions.web_search:3", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"mesothelioma glioblastoma esophageal cancer 5 year survival rate statistics\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 881,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"92c418ade6cfb9cd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSurvival Rates for Pleural Mesothelioma | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"92c418ade6cfb9cd\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/malignant-mesothelioma/detection-diagnosis-staging/survival-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"88902d5573ce1c15\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFor example, if the 5-year relative survival rate for a specific stage of pleural mesothelioma is 30%, it means that people who have that cancer are, on average, <strong>about 30%</strong> as likely as people who don’t have that cancer to live for at least 5 years after being diagnosed.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"88902d5573ce1c15\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 3, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7905a22ac4bb1b5b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Survival Rate | Moffitt\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7905a22ac4bb1b5b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.moffitt.org/cancers/mesothelioma/survival-rate/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3fa6378ffd6a7799\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAs of 2022, the overall five-year survival rate for advanced stage mesothelioma at Moffitt Cancer Center is <strong>17.3%</strong>. Most cases are diagnosed when the cancer is in an advanced stage and is more difficult to treat.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3fa6378ffd6a7799\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.moffitt.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ccf34cd83e1c66be\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Survival Rate: What Impacts a Patient's Survival Time?\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ccf34cd83e1c66be\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.asbestos.com/mesothelioma/survival-rate/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8a7d465a93f3be29\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe average survival rate for mesothelioma is about 18 months after diagnosis with treatment. The 5-year survival rate for pleural mesothelioma is approximately <strong>12%</strong>. Some patients have lived for more than 10 years after treatment.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8a7d465a93f3be29\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 10, 2013\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.asbestos.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1c875391329d6a76\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Life Expectancy & Survival Rate in 2026\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1c875391329d6a76\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sokolovelaw.com/mesothelioma/life-expectancy/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1aea5dcfd059e456\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAccording to the American Cancer Society (ACS), the 5-year survival rate (or the percentage of people who live 5 years past diagnosis) for people with mesothelioma is <strong>between 5 and 10 percent</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1aea5dcfd059e456\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"3 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sokolovelaw.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f867f1299ba2afe\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Prognosis | Stage 1 to Stage 4 Survival Rates (2026)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f867f1299ba2afe\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sokolovelaw.com/mesothelioma/prognosis/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1a2e0136a20ddd48\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma patients in stage 3 have a median life expectancy of 16 months and 5-year survival rate of <strong>11%</strong>. Stage 3 mesothelioma is usually too advanced for mesothelioma oncologists (cancer doctors) to safely and effectively remove through ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1a2e0136a20ddd48\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"3 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sokolovelaw.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "mesothelioma glioblastoma esophageal cancer 5 year survival rate statistics", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 881, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"92c418ade6cfb9cd\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nSurvival Rates for Pleural Mesothelioma | American Cancer Society\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"92c418ade6cfb9cd\">>>", "url": "https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/malignant-mesothelioma/detection-diagnosis-staging/survival-statistics.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"88902d5573ce1c15\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFor example, if the 5-year relative survival rate for a specific stage of pleural mesothelioma is 30%, it means that people who have that cancer are, on average, <strong>about 30%</strong> as likely as people who don’t have that cancer to live for at least 5 years after being diagnosed.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"88902d5573ce1c15\">>>", "published": "February 3, 2026", "siteName": "www.cancer.org"}, {"title": "\n<<<EX